<!-- Tree of Options (v2.0) -->
<!-- ===================================================================== -->
<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">🌳 Tree of Options</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>
      Give each option a materialized dot-path (<code>"1"</code>, <code>"1.1"</code>, <code>"1.1.1"</code>, …)
      and set <code>path-member</code>. Tree mode auto-enables: the component derives parent and depth from
      the path and renders the options depth-first, indented by level. The tree is always fully expanded
      (no chevron) — reach for <code>@keenmate/web-treeview</code> when you need expand/collapse.
    </p>

    <div class="pc-row" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      <div class="pc-col-100 pc-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Basic Tree — every node expanded</label>
          <web-multiselect id="tree-basic" multiple="true"></web-multiselect>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Branch + leaf nodes are all selectable, indented by depth</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pc-col-100 pc-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Ancestor-Preserving Search</label>
          <web-multiselect id="tree-search" multiple="true" search-enabled="true"></web-multiselect>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Open, type <code>kale</code> → Vegetables → Leafy → Kale (ancestors kept)</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pc-row">
      <div class="pc-col-100 pc-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Selectable Leaves Only + Checkboxes</label>
          <web-multiselect id="tree-leaves" multiple="true" show-checkboxes="true"></web-multiselect>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Branches are pure structure — no checkbox, skipped by keyboard</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pc-col-100 pc-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Full Breadcrumb on Badges</label>
          <web-multiselect id="tree-fulltitle" multiple="true" show-badge-full-title="true"></web-multiselect>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Two items pre-selected — badges show <em>Fruit / Pome fruit / Apple</em></small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pc-row">
      <div class="pc-col-100">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Cascade Checkboxes — check a branch, check the whole subtree</label>
          <web-multiselect id="tree-cascade" multiple="true" show-checkboxes="true"
            checkbox-mode="cascade" actions-position="top"></web-multiselect>
          <small class="pa-form-text">
            Tristate (dash) on partial branches; Select All emits the rolled-up roots.
            Emitted <code>getValue()</code>: <code id="cascade-emitted" class="text-xs">[]</code>
          </small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Real data — full ISCO-08 -->
<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">Real Data — Full ISCO-08 Classification</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>
      Everything at once on real data: the whole <strong>International Standard Classification of
      Occupations</strong> (ISCO-08) — 619 groups (10 major → 43 sub-major → 130 minor → 436 unit).
      The ISCO code <em>is</em> the hierarchy (<code>2211</code> → path <code>2.22.221.2211</code>), so it
      drops straight into <code>path-member</code>. Only the <strong>unit groups</strong> (leaves) are
      selectable. A <code>getSearchValueCallback</code> widens the filter to match the title, ISCO code,
      and full breadcrumb; virtual scroll keeps 600+ rows smooth.
    </p>
    <div class="pc-row" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      <div class="pc-col-100">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Search e.g. <code>welder</code>, <code>2211</code>, or <code>health</code> — then hover a badge</label>
          <web-multiselect id="tree-isco" multiple="true" search-enabled="true"
            enable-virtual-scroll="true" option-height="32"
            enable-badge-tooltips="true" enable-option-tooltips="true"
            badges-display-mode="partial" badges-max-visible="3"
            style="--ms-option-padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem; --ms-option-title-white-space: nowrap; --ms-option-title-overflow: hidden; --ms-option-title-text-overflow: ellipsis;"></web-multiselect>
          <small class="pa-form-text">
            Badge shows the leaf title only (prefixed <code>.. /</code>); full breadcrumb in the badge tooltip.
            Source: ISCO-08 (© International Labour Organization) — demo data.
          </small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

