    <p>
      On phones the dropdown opens as a <strong>full-screen overlay</strong> instead of a floating panel —
      a touch-friendly sheet with its own search header, big rows, and a close button. The
      <code>mobile-presentation</code> attribute (<code>auto</code> | <code>floating</code> |
      <code>fullscreen</code>) picks the presentation; <code>auto</code> uses the sheet only on phones.
      Because it's usually a phone-only look, each demo offers a <em>Preview as fullscreen</em> toggle so
      you can inspect the overlay on desktop.
    </p>

    <div class="pc-row" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
